#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Wireplumber"
msgstr "Instalação do Wireplumber"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Wireplumber</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Wireplumber</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:104
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release -D system-lua=true .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release -D system-lua=true .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:118
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Finally, rename the documentation directory to a versioned directory as the "
"&root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Por fim, renomeie o diretório de documentação para um diretório versionado "
"como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:125
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mv -v /usr/share/doc/wireplumber{,-&wireplumber-"
"version;}</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mv -v /usr/share/doc/wireplumber{,-&wireplumber-"
"version;}</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:130
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D system-lua=true</parameter>: This switch enables using the "
"system version of Lua. Omit this switch if you have not installed Lua, but "
"note that <application>meson</application> will download and install it's "
"own version."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D system-lua=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita usar a versão"
" do sistema de Lua. Omita essa chave se você não tiver instalado Lua, mas "
"observe que <application>meson</application> baixará e instalará a própria "
"versão dele."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Wireplumber"
msgstr "Configurando Wireplumber"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:150
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order for Wireplumber to be used by Pipewire, Wireplumber and Pipewire "
"must be configured to start when a desktop environment is started."
msgstr ""
"Para a finalidade de que o Wireplumber seja usado pelo Pipewire, o "
"Wireplumber e o Pipewire precisam ser configurados para iniciar quando um "
"ambiente de área de trabalho for iniciado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Pipewire now provides it's own Pulseaudio server implementation, which "
"causes runtime conflicts with the server provided by Pulseaudio itself.  "
"This generally presents itself by applications hanging or malfunctioning "
"when trying to play or record audio and video. First, prevent Pulseaudio "
"from starting it's own server implementation by running the following "
"commands as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"O Pipewire agora fornece a própria implementação dele de servidor "
"Pulseaudio, o que causa conflitos de tempo de execução com o servidor "
"fornecido pelo próprio Pulseaudio. Isso geralmente se apresenta por "
"aplicativos travando ou com mau funcionamento ao tentar reproduzir ou gravar"
" áudio e vídeo. Primeiro, evite que o Pulseaudio inicie a própria "
"implementação dele de servidor executando os seguintes comandos como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:164
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>rm -vf /etc/xdg/autostart/pulseaudio.desktop         &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -vf /etc/xdg/Xwayland-session.d/00-pulseaudio-x11 &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -e '$a autospawn = no' -i /etc/pulse/client.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>rm -vf /etc/xdg/autostart/pulseaudio.desktop         &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -vf /etc/xdg/Xwayland-session.d/00-pulseaudio-x11 &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -e '$a autospawn = no' -i /etc/pulse/client.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Next, configure Wireplumber to start when a desktop environment is started. "
"Run the following commands as the &root; user to enable the systemd user "
"units:"
msgstr ""
"A seguir, configure o Wireplumber para iniciar quando um ambiente de área de"
" trabalho for iniciado. Execute os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&root; para habilitar as unidades de usuário(a) do systemd:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:174
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>systemctl enable --global pipewire.socket       &amp;&amp;\n"
"systemctl enable --global pipewire-pulse.socket &amp;&amp;\n"
"systemctl enable --global wireplumber</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>systemctl enable --global pipewire.socket       &amp;&amp;\n"
"systemctl enable --global pipewire-pulse.socket &amp;&amp;\n"
"systemctl enable --global wireplumber</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Next, create a shell script that will start Wireplumber and Pipewire in the "
"correct order as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"A seguir, crie um conjunto de comandos sequenciais de shell que iniciará o "
"Wireplumber e o Pipewire, na ordem correta, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:183
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"# Begin /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh\n"
"\n"
"# First, kill any previous instances of pipewire, wireplumber, or pipewire-pulse\n"
"# that are running. Multiple instances of the daemon can not be run at the same\n"
"# time, and this helps prevent possible errors if a user logs out or logs in\n"
"# too fast, and restores audio if Pipewire hangs and needs to be reset.\n"
"\n"
"pkill -u ${USER} -fx /usr/bin/pipewire-pulse\n"
"pkill -u ${USER} -fx /usr/bin/wireplumber\n"
"pkill -u ${USER} -fx /usr/bin/pipewire\n"
"\n"
"# Start Pipewire first.\n"
"exec /usr/bin/pipewire &amp;\n"
"\n"
"# Next, we need to wait until pipewire is up before starting wireplumber.\n"
"# This prevents a possible race condition where pipewire takes too long\n"
"# to start, as some users have run into.\n"
"while [ $(pgrep -f /usr/bin/pipewire) = \"\" ]; do\n"
"   sleep 1\n"
"done\n"
"\n"
"# Start Wireplumber now that Pipewire has been started.\n"
"exec /usr/bin/wireplumber &amp;\n"
"\n"
"# Start the Pulseaudio server included with Pipewire.\n"
"exec /usr/bin/pipewire-pulse &amp;\n"
"\n"
"# End /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"# Begin /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh\n"
"\n"
"# First, kill any previous instances of pipewire, wireplumber, or pipewire-pulse\n"
"# that are running. Multiple instances of the daemon can not be run at the same\n"
"# time, and this helps prevent possible errors if a user logs out or logs in\n"
"# too fast, and restores audio if Pipewire hangs and needs to be reset.\n"
"\n"
"pkill -u ${USER} -fx /usr/bin/pipewire-pulse\n"
"pkill -u ${USER} -fx /usr/bin/wireplumber\n"
"pkill -u ${USER} -fx /usr/bin/pipewire\n"
"\n"
"# Start Pipewire first.\n"
"exec /usr/bin/pipewire &amp;\n"
"\n"
"# Next, we need to wait until pipewire is up before starting wireplumber.\n"
"# This prevents a possible race condition where pipewire takes too long\n"
"# to start, as some users have run into.\n"
"while [ $(pgrep -f /usr/bin/pipewire) = \"\" ]; do\n"
"   sleep 1\n"
"done\n"
"\n"
"# Start Wireplumber now that Pipewire has been started.\n"
"exec /usr/bin/wireplumber &amp;\n"
"\n"
"# Start the Pulseaudio server included with Pipewire.\n"
"exec /usr/bin/pipewire-pulse &amp;\n"
"\n"
"# End /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:216
#, xml-text
msgid "Next, make this shell script executable as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"A seguir, torne esse conjunto de comandos sequenciais de shell executável "
"como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:219
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>chmod +x /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>chmod +x /usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:222
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Finally, create an XDG Autostart file that will run "
"<command>/usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</command> when a desktop environment "
"is started, as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, crie um arquivo de auto iniciação do XDG que executará "
"<command>/usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh</command> quando um ambiente de área "
"de trabalho for iniciado; como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:227
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/xdg/autostart/pipewire.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Version=1.0\n"
"Name=Pipewire\n"
"Comment=Starts the Pipewire and Wireplumber daemons\n"
"Exec=/usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/xdg/autostart/pipewire.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Version=1.0\n"
"Name=Pipewire\n"
"Comment=Inicia os processos de segundo plano Pipewire e Wireplumber\n"
"Exec=/usr/bin/pipewire-launcher.sh\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/wireplumber.xml:238
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now that Wireplumber is configured to start when a desktop environment is "
"started, it is recommended that you log out of your session and log back in "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Agora que o Wireplumber está configurado para iniciar quando um ambiente de "
"área de trabalho for iniciado, é recomendado que você se deslogue da teu "
"sessão e se logue novamente."

